# Plan: agents-arwaky — Business Analyst

## Summary

This business analysis covers the `agents-arwaky` unified tool orchestrator ecosystem, evaluating the Python-based CLI (`arwaky.py`), shared libraries (`tools/lib/`), daemon managers (`tools/daemons/`), backup/restore system (`tools/backup/`), harness connector (`tools/connect/`), skill manager (`tools/skill/`), MCP configuration generator (`tools/mcp/`), and supporting configuration files (`tools/config/`). The analysis validates requirements clarity, business flow integrity, logic correctness, testability, and FRD-to-code traceability across all registered tools and orchestration layers.

